    "D\u0131\u015fa D\u00f6n\u00fck Kanallar": "L\u00e4htev\u00e4t kanavat", // EN: Outbound Channels
    "Olaylar uygulaman\u0131n i\u00e7inde kal\u0131r; istersen ayn\u0131 uyar\u0131y\u0131 telefonunun uyar\u0131 merkezine veya Telegram'a da g\u00f6nder. Hi\u00e7biri zorunlu de\u011fil.": "Tapahtumat pysyv\u00e4t sovelluksen sis\u00e4ll\u00e4;jos haluat, l\u00e4het\u00e4 sama h\u00e4lytys puhelimesi ilmoituskeskukseen tai Telegramiin.Mit\u00e4\u00e4n n\u00e4ist\u00e4 ei vaadita.", // EN: Events stay inside the app; if you want, send the same alert to your phone's notification centre or to Telegram. None of these is required.
    "Konu ad\u0131 yaz, hesap gerekmez": "Anna aiheen nimi \u2013 tili\u00e4 ei tarvita", // EN: Enter a topic name — no account needed
    "Konu (topic)": "Aihe", // EN: Topic
    "Bildirimler ntfy.sh \u00fczerinde bu konuya g\u00f6nderilir; konu ad\u0131n\u0131 sadece sen biliyorsan bildirimi sadece sen al\u0131rs\u0131n.": "Aiheeseen liittyv\u00e4t ilmoitukset julkaistaan osoitteessa ntfy.sh;jos vain tied\u00e4t aiheen nimen, vain sin\u00e4 saat ne.", // EN: Notifications are published to this topic on ntfy.sh; if only you know the topic name, only you receive them.
    "E-posta": "S\u00e4hk\u00f6posti", // EN: Email
    "Uyar\u0131lar hesab\u0131n\u0131n e-posta adresine gider": "H\u00e4lytykset l\u00e4hetet\u00e4\u00e4n tilisi s\u00e4hk\u00f6postiosoitteeseen", // EN: Alerts are sent to your account's email address
    "Bulut oturumu a\u00e7\u0131kken kendi adresine g\u00f6nderilir; saklanacak anahtar yok.": "L\u00e4hetetty omaan osoitteeseesi ollessasi kirjautuneena;sovellukseen ei tallenneta salaisuuksia.", // EN: Sent to your own address while signed in; no secrets are stored in the app.
    "G\u00f6nderilecek adres": "Vastaanottaja", // EN: Recipient
    "Cihazlar Aras\u0131 Bildirim": "Laitteidenv\u00e4liset ilmoitukset", // EN: Cross-device Notifications
    "Aile \u00fcyesinin uyar\u0131s\u0131, o ki\u015finin uygulamas\u0131 kapal\u0131yken de bildirim merkezine d\u00fc\u015fer": "Perheenj\u00e4senen h\u00e4lytys saapuu ilmoituskeskukseen, vaikka sovellus olisi suljettu", // EN: A family member's alert arrives in the notification centre even when the app is closed
    "Di\u011fer \u00fcyelerin ve kendi di\u011fer cihazlar\u0131n\u0131n bildirim merkezine gider; al\u0131c\u0131 bu kanal\u0131 kendi cihaz\u0131nda a\u00e7m\u0131\u015f olmal\u0131.": "Menee muiden j\u00e4senten ja muiden laitteidesi ilmoituskeskuksiin;vastaanottajan on otettava t\u00e4m\u00e4 kanava k\u00e4ytt\u00f6\u00f6n laitteellaan.", // EN: Goes to other members' and your other devices' notification centres; the recipient must have this channel enabled on their device.
    "Kendi sunucuna JSON POST \u2014 geli\u015fmi\u015f": "JSON POST omalle palvelimellesi \u2013 edistynyt", // EN: JSON POST to your own server — advanced
    "HTTPS adresi": "HTTPS URL", // EN: HTTPS URL
    "Yaln\u0131zca HTTPS kabul edilir; her olay {source, id, title, detail, ts} olarak g\u00f6nderilir.": "Vain HTTPS hyv\u00e4ksyt\u00e4\u00e4n;jokainen tapahtuma l\u00e4hetet\u00e4\u00e4n muodossa {l\u00e4hde, tunnus, otsikko, yksityiskohta, ts}.", // EN: Only HTTPS is accepted; each event is sent as {source, id, title, detail, ts}.
    "Bot anahtar\u0131": "Botin tunnus", // EN: Bot token
    "Sohbet ID": "Chat-tunnus", // EN: Chat ID
    "Bot anahtar\u0131 yaln\u0131zca bu cihazda kal\u0131r": "Botin tunnus pysyy vain t\u00e4ss\u00e4 laitteessa", // EN: The bot token stays on this device only
    "Anahtar buluta y\u00fcklenmez; di\u011fer cihazlarda tekrar girmen gerekir.": "Tunnusta ei koskaan ladata pilveen.sy\u00f6t\u00e4 se uudelleen muilla laitteilla.", // EN: The token is never uploaded to the cloud; re-enter it on other devices.
    "Sistem Bildirimleri": "J\u00e4rjestelm\u00e4n ilmoitukset", // EN: System Notifications
    "Taray\u0131c\u0131 ve telefonun uyar\u0131 merkezi": "Selaimesi ja puhelimesi ilmoituskeskus", // EN: Your browser and phone notification centre
