    "Hesab\u0131n ve verilerin silindi.": "Tilisi ja tietosi poistettiin.", // EN: Your account and data were deleted.
    "Bu cihazdaki NEXUS verilerini silmek i\u00e7in Ayarlar \u2192 \u00c7\u0131k\u0131\u015f Yap yeterli; bulut hesab\u0131 yok.": "NEXUS-tietojen poistamiseksi t\u00e4lt\u00e4 laitteelta riitt\u00e4\u00e4 Asetukset \u2192 Kirjaudu ulos.pilvitili\u00e4 ei ole.", // EN: To remove NEXUS data on this device, Settings → Sign out is enough; there is no cloud account.
    "Hesap silme fonksiyonu hen\u00fcz da\u011f\u0131t\u0131lmad\u0131. \u015eimdilik \u00e7\u0131k\u0131\u015f yapabilirsin.": "Palvelinpuolen tilin poistamista ei ole viel\u00e4 otettu k\u00e4ytt\u00f6\u00f6n.Voit kirjautua ulos toistaiseksi.", // EN: The server-side account deletion isn't deployed yet. You can sign out for now.
    "! Rahats\u0131z etme modunu a\u00e7t\u0131m, hi\u00e7bir bildirim seni rahats\u0131z etmeyecek. [ACTION: ENABLE_DND]": "!Laitoin \u00c4l\u00e4 h\u00e4iritse p\u00e4\u00e4lle;mik\u00e4\u00e4n ilmoitus ei h\u00e4iritse sinua.[TOIMI: ENABLE_DND]", // EN: ! I turned on Do Not Disturb; no notifications will bother you. [ACTION: ENABLE_DND]
    "\" senaryosunu \u015fimdilik ana ekrandaki T\u0131kla ve \u00c7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131r kart\u0131ndan tek dokunu\u015fla \u00e7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131rabilirsin. NEXUS App Store'da yay\u0131nland\u0131\u011f\u0131nda bu ekrandan do\u011frudan Siri'ye ekleyebileceksin.": "\" skenaario voidaan suorittaa yhdell\u00e4 napautuksella aloitusn\u00e4yt\u00f6n Napauta suorita -kortista. Kun NEXUS on App Storessa, voit lis\u00e4t\u00e4 sen Siriin suoraan t\u00e4lt\u00e4 n\u00e4yt\u00f6lt\u00e4.", // EN: " scenario can be run with one tap from the Tap to Run card on the home screen for now. Once NEXUS is on the App Store, you'll be able to add it to Siri directly from this screen.
