    "Bu 8 haneli kod Apple HomeKit e\u015fle\u015ftirmesi i\u00e7indir ve yaln\u0131zca Apple Ev uygulamas\u0131yla kullan\u0131l\u0131r. Cihaz Shelly, WLED, Tasmota gibi yerel API destekliyorsa yerel a\u011fdan ekleyebilirsin.": "T\u00e4m\u00e4 8-numeroinen koodi on Apple HomeKitin pariliitosta varten ja toimii vain Apple Home -sovelluksen kanssa.Jos laite tukee paikallista API:ta, kuten Shelly\u00e4, WLED:t\u00e4 tai Tasmotaa, voit lis\u00e4t\u00e4 sen l\u00e4hiverkostasi.", // EN: This 8-digit code is for Apple HomeKit pairing and only works with the Apple Home app. If the device supports a local API such as Shelly, WLED or Tasmota, you can add it from your local network.
    "Bu Cihaz": "T\u00e4m\u00e4 laite", // EN: This Device
    "Bu QR kodu bir Wi-Fi a\u011f\u0131na aittir, cihaz de\u011fildir. Cihaz\u0131 ayn\u0131 a\u011fa ba\u011flad\u0131ktan sonra yerel a\u011fdan ekleyebilirsin.": "T\u00e4m\u00e4 QR-koodi kuuluu Wi-Fi-verkkoon, ei laitteelle.Kun olet yhdist\u00e4nyt laitteen samaan verkkoon, voit lis\u00e4t\u00e4 sen l\u00e4hiverkostasi.", // EN: This QR code belongs to a Wi-Fi network, not a device. After connecting the device to the same network, you can add it from your local network.
    "Bu adreste bilinen bir NEXUS cihaz\u0131 bulunamad\u0131. Cihaz\u0131n ayn\u0131 a\u011fda ve a\u00e7\u0131k oldu\u011fundan emin ol.": "T\u00e4st\u00e4 osoitteesta ei l\u00f6ytynyt tunnettua NEXUS-laitetta.Varmista, ett\u00e4 laite on p\u00e4\u00e4ll\u00e4 ja samassa verkossa.", // EN: No known NEXUS device was found at this address. Make sure the device is on and on the same network.
    "Bu ak\u0131ll\u0131 uygulamay\u0131 olu\u015ftur:": "Luo t\u00e4m\u00e4 \u00e4lyk\u00e4s sovellus:", // EN: Create this smart app:
    "Bu ak\u0131\u015f i\u00e7in \u00f6nerilen \u00f6zellikler haz\u0131rlan\u0131yor.": "Valmistellaan t\u00e4h\u00e4n kulkuun ehdotettuja ominaisuuksia.", // EN: Preparing suggested features for this flow.
    "Bu ayki tasarruf": "Tallennettu t\u00e4ss\u00e4 kuussa", // EN: Saved this month
    "Bu a\u011fda desteklenen bir cihaz bulunamad\u0131.": "T\u00e4st\u00e4 verkosta ei l\u00f6ytynyt tuettua laitetta.", // EN: No supported device was found on this network.
    "Bu a\u011fda desteklenen bir cihaz bulunamad\u0131. Cihaz\u0131n a\u00e7\u0131k ve ayn\u0131 Wi-Fi'da oldu\u011fundan emin ol; olmazsa a\u015fa\u011f\u0131dan katalo\u011fu ya da QR / kurulum kodunu kullan.": "T\u00e4st\u00e4 verkosta ei l\u00f6ytynyt tuettua laitetta.Varmista, ett\u00e4 laite on p\u00e4\u00e4ll\u00e4 ja yhdistetty samaan Wi-Fi-verkkoon;muussa tapauksessa k\u00e4yt\u00e4 alla olevaa luetteloa tai QR-/asetuskoodia.", // EN: No supported device was found on this network. Make sure the device is on and connected to the same Wi-Fi; otherwise use the catalog below or a QR / setup code.
    "Bu cihaz i\u00e7in yerel koruma": "Paikallinen suojaus t\u00e4lle laitteelle", // EN: Local protection for this device
    "Bu cihaz s\u00fcr\u00fcm bilgisi payla\u015fm\u0131yor": "T\u00e4m\u00e4 laite ei jaa versiotietoja", // EN: This device doesn't share version info
    "Bu cihaz veya ba\u011flant\u0131 fener deste\u011fi sunmuyor.": "T\u00e4m\u00e4 laite tai liit\u00e4nt\u00e4 ei tue taskulamppua.", // EN: This device or connection doesn't support the flashlight.
    "Bu cihazda otomatik konum deste\u011fi yok.": "T\u00e4m\u00e4 laite ei tue automaattista paikannusta.", // EN: This device doesn't support automatic location.
    "Bu davet kodu bulunamad\u0131.": "T\u00e4t\u00e4 kutsukoodia ei l\u00f6ytynyt.", // EN: This invite code wasn't found.
    "Bu ekran, ekledi\u011fin ayd\u0131nlatma cihazlar\u0131n\u0131 odalara g\u00f6re toplar; sahne kaydetti\u011finde \u0131\u015f\u0131klar\u0131n parlakl\u0131\u011f\u0131 ve tonu birlikte ayarlan\u0131r.": "T\u00e4m\u00e4 n\u00e4ytt\u00f6 ryhmittelee lis\u00e4\u00e4m\u00e4si valaistuslaitteet huoneittain;kun tallennat kohtauksen, kirkkaus ja s\u00e4vy asetetaan yhdess\u00e4.", // EN: This screen groups the lighting devices you've added by room; when you save a scene, brightness and tone are set together.
    "Bu eve ekledi\u011fin cihazlar burada listelenir.": "T\u00e4h\u00e4n kotiin lis\u00e4\u00e4m\u00e4si laitteet on lueteltu t\u00e4ss\u00e4.", // EN: Devices you add to this home are listed here.
    "Bu eve ekledi\u011fin cihazlar burada listelenir ve favori kartlar\u0131na ba\u011flan\u0131r.": "T\u00e4h\u00e4n kotiin lis\u00e4\u00e4m\u00e4si laitteet on lueteltu t\u00e4ss\u00e4 ja linkitetty suosikkikortteihisi.", // EN: Devices you add to this home are listed here and linked to your favorite cards.
    "Bu evi ve t\u00fcm ayarlar\u0131n\u0131 kal\u0131c\u0131 olarak silmek istedi\u011fine emin misin?": "Haluatko varmasti poistaa t\u00e4m\u00e4n kodin ja kaikki sen asetukset pysyv\u00e4sti?", // EN: Are you sure you want to permanently delete this home and all its settings?
    "Bu kod desteklenen bir cihaz kodu de\u011fil. Cihaz\u0131n IP adresini biliyorsan yerel a\u011fdan ekleyebilirsin.": "T\u00e4m\u00e4 koodi ei ole tuettu laitekoodi.Jos tied\u00e4t laitteen IP-osoitteen, voit lis\u00e4t\u00e4 sen l\u00e4hiverkostasi.", // EN: This code isn't a supported device code. If you know the device's IP address, you can add it from your local network.
    "Bu markalar yerel a\u011fdan kontrol edilir": "N\u00e4it\u00e4 merkkej\u00e4 ohjataan paikallisverkossasi", // EN: These brands are controlled over your local network
    "Bu mini uygulama resm\u00ee sa\u011flay\u0131c\u0131 taraf\u0131ndan sunulur.": "T\u00e4m\u00e4n minisovelluksen tarjoaa virallinen palveluntarjoaja.", // EN: This mini app is provided by the official provider.
    "Bu ortam kamera eri\u015fimini desteklemiyor.": "T\u00e4m\u00e4 ymp\u00e4rist\u00f6 ei tue kameran k\u00e4ytt\u00f6\u00e4.", // EN: This environment doesn't support camera access.
    "Bu ortamda a\u011f taramas\u0131 kullan\u0131lam\u0131yor.": "Verkkoskannaus ei ole k\u00e4ytett\u00e4viss\u00e4 t\u00e4\u00e4ll\u00e4.", // EN: Network scanning isn't available here.
    "Bu ortamda g\u00fcvenli \u015fifreleme yok": "Ei suojattua salausta t\u00e4ss\u00e4 ymp\u00e4rist\u00f6ss\u00e4", // EN: No secure encryption in this environment
    "Bu senaryo aktifle\u015fti\u011finde ilgili cihazlar otomatik olarak ayarlan\u0131r.": "Kun t\u00e4m\u00e4 skenaario suoritetaan, siihen liittyv\u00e4t laitteet s\u00e4\u00e4det\u00e4\u00e4n automaattisesti.", // EN: When this scenario runs, the related devices are adjusted automatically.
    "Bu senaryodan etkilenen cihaz yok \u2014 \u00f6nce uygun cihaz ekle.": "T\u00e4m\u00e4 skenaario ei vaikuta laitteisiin \u2013 lis\u00e4\u00e4 ensin sopiva laite.", // EN: No devices are affected by this scenario — add a suitable device first.
    "Bu senaryoyu kullanmak i\u00e7in uyumlu cihaz eklemelisin.": "Sinun on lis\u00e4tt\u00e4v\u00e4 yhteensopiva laite, jotta voit k\u00e4ytt\u00e4\u00e4 t\u00e4t\u00e4 skenaariota.", // EN: You need to add a compatible device to use this scenario.
    "Bu tek evin. Silersen bo\u015f bir \"Evim\" yeniden olu\u015fturulur. Devam edilsin mi?": "T\u00e4m\u00e4 on ainoa kotisi.Jos poistat sen, tyhj\u00e4 \"Oma koti\" luodaan uudelleen.Jatkaa?", // EN: This is your only home. If you delete it, an empty "My Home" will be created again. Continue?
