    "Cihaz\u0131m neden \u00e7evrimd\u0131\u015f\u0131 g\u00f6r\u00fcn\u00fcyor?": "Miksi laitteeni n\u00e4kyy offline-tilassa?", // EN: Why does my device show as offline?
