    "Cihaz\u0131n Wi-Fi ba\u011flant\u0131s\u0131n\u0131 ve modemini kontrol et. Sorun s\u00fcrerse cihaz\u0131 kald\u0131r\u0131p yeniden ekle. Ad\u0131mlar: Cihazlar > cihaz\u0131 se\u00e7 > Kald\u0131r.": "Tarkista laitteen Wi-Fi-yhteys ja reititin.Jos ongelma jatkuu, poista laite ja lis\u00e4\u00e4 se uudelleen.Vaiheet: Laitteet > valitse laite > Poista.", // EN: Check the device's Wi-Fi connection and your router. If the problem continues, remove the device and add it again. Steps: Devices > choose the device > Remove.
    "Cihaz\u0131n Wi-Fi ba\u011flant\u0131s\u0131n\u0131 ve modeminizi kontrol edin. Sorun s\u00fcrerse cihaz\u0131 NEXUS uygulamas\u0131ndan kald\u0131r\u0131p yeniden ekleyin.": "Tarkista laitteen Wi-Fi-yhteys ja reititin.Jos ongelma jatkuu, poista laite NEXUS-sovelluksesta ja lis\u00e4\u00e4 se uudelleen.", // EN: Check the device's Wi-Fi connection and your router. If the problem continues, remove the device from the NEXUS app and add it again.
    "Cihaz\u0131n g\u00f6r\u00fcnm\u00fcyorsa QR tarama veya kurulum kodu yolunu kullan. Destek ve y\u00f6nlendirme i\u00e7in yard\u0131m sayfas\u0131n\u0131 a\u00e7abilirsin.": "Jos laitteesi ei tule n\u00e4kyviin, k\u00e4yt\u00e4 QR-skannausta tai asetuskoodia.Voit avata ohjesivun saadaksesi tukea ja ohjeita.", // EN: If your device doesn't show up, use QR scanning or a setup code. You can open the help page for support and guidance.
    "Cihaz\u0131n konum (GPS) servisi kapal\u0131. A\u00e7\u0131p tekrar dene.": "Laitteesi sijaintipalvelu (GPS) on pois p\u00e4\u00e4lt\u00e4.Kytke se p\u00e4\u00e4lle ja yrit\u00e4 uudelleen.", // EN: Your device's location (GPS) service is off. Turn it on and try again.
    "Cihaz\u0131n konum servisini desteklemiyor.": "Laitteesi ei tue sijaintipalveluita.", // EN: Your device doesn't support location services.
    "Cihaz\u0131n listede yok mu? Geri bildirim g\u00f6nder": "Eik\u00f6 laite ole luettelossa?L\u00e4het\u00e4 palautetta", // EN: Device not on the list? Send feedback
