    "Evde a\u00e7\u0131k kalan t\u00fcm ayd\u0131nlatma gruplar\u0131n\u0131 kapat.": "Sammuta kaikki kodin p\u00e4\u00e4lle j\u00e4tetyt valaistusryhm\u00e4t.", // EN: Turn off all lighting groups left on at home.
