    "Evde yok": "Pois", // EN: Away
    "Evde yokken": "Kun poissa", // EN: When away
    "Evdeki ayd\u0131nlatma cihazlar\u0131n\u0131 oda bazl\u0131 tek bir ak\u0131\u015f i\u00e7inde y\u00f6net. A\u00e7 kapa, parlakl\u0131k, renk s\u0131cakl\u0131\u011f\u0131 ve h\u0131zl\u0131 sahne k\u0131sayollar\u0131 ayn\u0131 uygulamada toplans\u0131n.": "Hallitse kotisi valoja huone kerrallaan.P\u00e4\u00e4lle/pois, kirkkaus, v\u00e4ril\u00e4mp\u00f6tila ja nopeat kohtauksen pikakuvakkeet yhdess\u00e4 sovelluksessa.", // EN: Manage the lights in your home room by room in one flow. On/off, brightness, color temperature and quick scene shortcuts in one app.
    "Evdeki cihazlara g\u00f6re haz\u0131r komutlar, h\u0131zl\u0131 otomasyonlar ve ak\u0131ll\u0131 uygulama \u00f6nerileri ver.": "Anna valmiita komentoja, nopeita automaatioita ja \u00e4lykk\u00e4it\u00e4 sovellusehdotuksia kotona olevien laitteiden perusteella.", // EN: Give ready commands, quick automations and smart app suggestions based on the devices at home.
    "Evdeki klima ve termostatlar\u0131 tek panelde y\u00f6neten bir iklim konfor uygulamas\u0131 olu\u015ftur. S\u0131cakl\u0131k ayar\u0131, h\u0131zl\u0131 mod se\u00e7enekleri, eko modu ve oda bazl\u0131 kontrol aksiyonlar\u0131 olsun.": "Luo ilmastoitu sovellus, joka hallitsee kodin ilmastointilaitteita ja termostaatteja yhdest\u00e4 paneelista.Sis\u00e4lt\u00e4\u00e4 l\u00e4mp\u00f6tilan s\u00e4\u00e4d\u00f6n, pikatilat, ekotilan ja huonekohtaiset toiminnot.", // EN: Create a climate comfort app that manages the ACs and thermostats in your home from one panel. Include temperature control, quick modes, eco mode and room-based actions.
    "Evimdeki cihazlar\u0131n durumu nedir?": "Mik\u00e4 on laitteideni tila?", // EN: What is the status of my devices?
