    "Evden \u00c7\u0131k\u0131\u015f\u0131 Tamamla": "Lopeta poistuminen kotoa", // EN: Finish Leaving Home
    "Evden \u00e7\u0131karken a\u00e7\u0131k cihazlar\u0131, kilit durumunu ve enerji ayarlar\u0131n\u0131 tek ekranda g\u00f6steren bir \u00e7\u0131k\u0131\u015f kontrol\u00fc uygulamas\u0131 olu\u015ftur. H\u0131zl\u0131 kapatma ve g\u00fcvenlik aktif etme butonlar\u0131 ekle.": "Luo kotoa l\u00e4htemisen tarkistussovellus, joka n\u00e4ytt\u00e4\u00e4 p\u00e4\u00e4lle j\u00e4tetyt laitteet, lukituksen tilan ja energia-asetukset yhdell\u00e4 n\u00e4yt\u00f6ll\u00e4.Lis\u00e4\u00e4 nopeat sammutus- ja suojauspainikkeet.", // EN: Create a leaving-home check app that shows devices left on, lock status and energy settings on one screen. Add quick shut-off and security activation buttons.
    "Evden \u00e7\u0131karken a\u00e7\u0131k cihazlar\u0131, kilitleri ve enerji durumunu tek ak\u0131\u015fta kontrol edin.": "Tarkista p\u00e4\u00e4lle j\u00e4tetyt laitteet, lukot ja energiatila yhdell\u00e4 virtauksella poistuessasi kotoa.", // EN: Check devices left on, locks and energy status in one flow when leaving home.
    "Evden \u00e7\u0131karken a\u00e7\u0131k cihazlar\u0131, kilitleri ve enerji durumunu tek ekranda g\u00f6ster.": "N\u00e4yt\u00e4 p\u00e4\u00e4lle j\u00e4tetyt laitteet, lukot ja energian tila yhdell\u00e4 n\u00e4yt\u00f6ll\u00e4, kun poistut kotoa.", // EN: Show devices left on, locks and energy status on one screen when leaving home.
    "Evden \u00e7\u0131kmadan \u00f6nce a\u00e7\u0131k kalan \u0131\u015f\u0131k, priz, klima ve g\u00fcvenlik ayarlar\u0131n\u0131 tek panelde g\u00f6r. H\u0131zl\u0131 kapatma ve g\u00fcvenlik aktif etme ad\u0131mlar\u0131n\u0131 tek ak\u0131\u015fa topla.": "Katso valot, pistokkeet, AC:t ja suojausasetukset, jotka on j\u00e4tetty p\u00e4\u00e4lle ennen kotoa l\u00e4ht\u00f6\u00e4, yhdelt\u00e4 paneelilta.Kokoa nopeat sammutus- ja suojausaktivointivaiheet yhdeksi virtaukseksi.", // EN: See lights, plugs, ACs and security settings left on before leaving home, on one panel. Gather quick shut-off and security activation steps into one flow.
    "Evden \u00e7\u0131kmadan \u00f6nce son kontrolleri yapal\u0131m.": "Tehd\u00e4\u00e4n viimeiset tarkastukset ennen l\u00e4ht\u00f6\u00e4.", // EN: Let's do the final checks before you leave.
    "Evden \u00e7\u0131kt\u0131ktan sonra \u0131\u015f\u0131\u011f\u0131 otom...": "Sammuta valot automaattisesti l\u00e4hd\u00f6n j\u00e4lkeen...", // EN: Turn off the lights automatically after leav...
    "Evden \u00e7\u0131kt\u0131ktan sonra \u0131\u015f\u0131\u011f\u0131 otomatik olarak kapat": "Sammuta valot automaattisesti poistuttuasi kotoa", // EN: Turn off the lights automatically after leaving home
    "Evden \u00e7\u0131kt\u0131ktan sonra \u0131\u015f\u0131\u011f\u0131 otomatik olarak kapat\u0131n ve eve d\u00f6nd\u00fckten sonra a\u00e7\u0131n.": "Sammuta valot automaattisesti l\u00e4htiess\u00e4si ja sytyt\u00e4 ne palatessasi.", // EN: Turn off the lights automatically after you leave and turn them on when you return.
    "Evde kimse yokken klimay\u0131 otomatik olarak kapat\u0131n, gereksiz t\u00fcketimi \u00f6nleyin.": "Sammuta ilmastointilaite automaattisesti, kun ket\u00e4\u00e4n ei ole kotona ja v\u00e4lt\u00e4 turhaa kulutusta.", // EN: Turn off the air conditioner automatically when nobody is home and avoid needless consumption.
    "Gece belirledi\u011fin saatte bekleme modundaki cihazlar\u0131n g\u00fcc\u00fcn\u00fc otomatik olarak kesin.": "Katkaise automaattisesti virta valmiustilassa olevista laitteista valitsemaasi aikaan y\u00f6ll\u00e4.", // EN: Automatically cut power to devices on standby at the time you choose at night.
