    "E\u015fle\u015ftirme kodu ge\u00e7ersiz. 11 haneli kodu ya da MT: ile ba\u015flayan QR i\u00e7eri\u011fini gir.": "The pairing code is not valid.Sy\u00f6t\u00e4 11-numeroinen koodi tai QR-sis\u00e4lt\u00f6, joka alkaa kirjaimella MT:.", // EN: The pairing code is not valid. Enter the 11-digit code or the QR content that starts with MT:.
    "Bu kodu NEXUS masa\u00fcst\u00fc uygulamas\u0131nda gir. Cihaz Wi-Fi ile ba\u011fl\u0131ysa yerel a\u011fdan IP adresiyle de ekleyebilirsin.": "Enter this code in the NEXUS desktop app.Jos laite on Wi-Fi-yhteydess\u00e4, voit lis\u00e4t\u00e4 sen my\u00f6s paikallisesta verkosta sen IP-osoitteen perusteella.", // EN: Enter this code in the NEXUS desktop app. If the device is on Wi-Fi, you can also add it from your local network by its IP address.
    "Cihaz ayn\u0131 a\u011fda aran\u0131yor ve e\u015fle\u015ftiriliyor. Bu bir dakikay\u0131 bulabilir; cihaz\u0131n a\u00e7\u0131k ve e\u015fle\u015ftirme modunda olmas\u0131 gerekir.": "Laitetta etsit\u00e4\u00e4n samasta verkosta ja muodostetaan laitepari.This can take up to a minute;the device must be on and in pairing mode.", // EN: The device is being searched for on the same network and paired. This can take up to a minute; the device must be on and in pairing mode.
    "Cihaz bulunamad\u0131 ya da e\u015fle\u015ftirilemedi. Ayn\u0131 a\u011fda, a\u00e7\u0131k ve e\u015fle\u015ftirme modunda oldu\u011fundan emin ol.": "Laitetta ei l\u00f6ytynyt tai sit\u00e4 ei voitu muodostaa pariksi.Varmista, ett\u00e4 se on samassa verkossa, p\u00e4\u00e4ll\u00e4 ja pariliitostilassa.", // EN: The device was not found or could not be paired. Make sure it is on the same network, powered on and in pairing mode.
    "Cihaz bulunamad\u0131. Ayn\u0131 a\u011fda, a\u00e7\u0131k ve e\u015fle\u015ftirme modunda oldu\u011fundan emin ol. Bilgisayar\u0131n g\u00fcvenlik duvar\u0131 yerel a\u011fdaki cihazlar\u0131n yan\u0131t\u0131n\u0131 engelliyor olabilir.": "Laitetta ei l\u00f6ytynyt.Varmista, ett\u00e4 se on samassa verkossa, p\u00e4\u00e4ll\u00e4 ja pariliitostilassa.Tietokoneesi palomuuri saattaa est\u00e4\u00e4 paikallisverkon laitteilta tulevat vastaukset.", // EN: The device was not found. Make sure it is on the same network, powered on and in pairing mode. Your computer's firewall may be blocking replies from devices on the local network.
    "Cihaz e\u015fle\u015ftirilemedi. E\u015fle\u015ftirme kodunu ve cihaz\u0131n e\u015fle\u015ftirme modunda oldu\u011funu kontrol et.": "Laitetta ei voitu muodostaa pariksi.Tarkista pariliitoskoodi ja ett\u00e4 laite on pariliitostilassa.", // EN: The device could not be paired. Check the pairing code and that the device is in pairing mode.
    "Cihaz e\u015fle\u015fti ama NEXUS'un kontrol edebilece\u011fi bir i\u015flevi yok.": "Laite on paritettu, mutta sill\u00e4 ei ole toimintoa, jota NEXUS voi ohjata.", // EN: The device paired but has no function NEXUS can control.
    "Cihaz yan\u0131t vermedi. A\u00e7\u0131k ve ayn\u0131 a\u011fda oldu\u011fundan emin ol.": "Laite ei vastannut.Varmista, ett\u00e4 se on p\u00e4\u00e4ll\u00e4 ja samassa verkossa.", // EN: The device did not respond. Make sure it is on and on the same network.
