    "Kap\u0131/pencere sens\u00f6r\u00fc a\u00e7\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131nda": "Kun ovi/ikkuna-anturi avautuu", // EN: When a door/window sensor opens
    "Duman, su bask\u0131n\u0131 ya da gaz sens\u00f6r\u00fc uyard\u0131\u011f\u0131nda": "Kun savu-, tulva- tai kaasuanturi h\u00e4lytt\u00e4\u00e4", // EN: When a smoke, flood or gas sensor raises an alarm
