    "Kap\u0131lar\u0131 kilitle": "Lukitse ovet", // EN: Lock the doors
    "B\u00fct\u00fcn \u0131\u015f\u0131klar\u0131 tam parlakl\u0131kta a\u00e7ar.": "Sytytt\u00e4\u00e4 kaikki valot t\u00e4ydell\u00e4 kirkkaudella.", // EN: Turns on every light at full brightness.
    "B\u00fct\u00fcn \u0131\u015f\u0131klar\u0131 kapat\u0131r.": "Sammuttaa kaikki valot.", // EN: Turns off every light.
    "I\u015f\u0131klar\u0131 tam parlakl\u0131kta, g\u00fcn \u0131\u015f\u0131\u011f\u0131 tonunda a\u00e7ar.": "Sytytt\u00e4\u00e4 valot t\u00e4ydell\u00e4 kirkkaudella p\u00e4iv\u00e4nvalossa.", // EN: Turns lights on at full brightness in a daylight tone.
    "I\u015f\u0131klar\u0131 %85 n\u00f6tr tona getirir, TV'yi kapat\u0131r.": "Asettaa valot 85 %:iin neutraalilla s\u00e4vyll\u00e4 ja sammuttaa television.", // EN: Sets lights to 85% in a neutral tone and turns off the TV.
    "I\u015f\u0131klar\u0131 %40 s\u0131cak tona getirir.": "Asettaa valot 40 %:iin l\u00e4mpim\u00e4ll\u00e4 s\u00e4vyll\u00e4.", // EN: Sets lights to 40% in a warm tone.
    "Her ak\u015fam 19:30": "Joka ilta klo 19.30", // EN: Every evening 19:30
    "Klimay\u0131 a\u00e7\u0131p 20\u00b0'ye, termostat\u0131 20\u00b0'ye ayarlar.": "Kytkee AC:n p\u00e4\u00e4lle 20\u00b0:een ja asettaa termostaatin 20\u00b0:een.", // EN: Turns the AC on at 20° and sets the thermostat to 20°.
    "Termostat\u0131 24\u00b0 konfor ayar\u0131na getirir.": "S\u00e4\u00e4t\u00e4\u00e4 termostaatin 24\u00b0 mukavuusasetukselle.", // EN: Sets the thermostat to a 24° comfort setting.
    "Hafta i\u00e7i 06:30": "Arkisin 06:30", // EN: Weekdays 06:30
    "B\u00fct\u00fcn perde ve panjurlar\u0131 a\u00e7ar.": "Avaa jokaisen verhon ja kaihtimen.", // EN: Opens every curtain and blind.
    "Her g\u00fcn g\u00fcn do\u011fumunda": "Joka p\u00e4iv\u00e4 auringonnousun aikaan", // EN: Every day at sunrise
    "B\u00fct\u00fcn perde ve panjurlar\u0131 kapat\u0131r.": "Sulkee kaikki verhot ja kaihtimet.", // EN: Closes every curtain and blind.
    "Her g\u00fcn g\u00fcn bat\u0131m\u0131nda": "Joka p\u00e4iv\u00e4 auringonlaskun aikaan", // EN: Every day at sunset
    "B\u00fct\u00fcn ak\u0131ll\u0131 kilitleri kilitler (kilit hi\u00e7bir zaman a\u00e7\u0131lmaz).": "Lukitsee jokaisen \u00e4lylukon (lukkoja ei koskaan avata).", // EN: Locks every smart lock (locks are never unlocked).
    "I\u015f\u0131klar\u0131 ve TV'yi kapat\u0131r; prizlere ve klimaya dokunmaz.": "Sammuttaa valot ja television;j\u00e4tt\u00e4\u00e4 pistokkeet ja AC rauhaan.", // EN: Turns off lights and the TV; leaves plugs and the AC alone.
    "Bir cihaz\u0131 a\u00e7 ya da kapat": "Kytke laite p\u00e4\u00e4lle tai pois p\u00e4\u00e4lt\u00e4", // EN: Turn a device on or off
    "Se\u00e7ti\u011fin tek cihaza komut g\u00f6nderir.": "L\u00e4hett\u00e4\u00e4 komennon valitsemallesi laitteelle.", // EN: Sends a command to the one device you pick.
    "Hangi cihaz?": "Mik\u00e4 laite?", // EN: Which device?
    "A\u00e7\u0131ls\u0131n": "Kytke p\u00e4\u00e4lle", // EN: Turn on
    "Kapans\u0131n": "Sammuta", // EN: Turn off
    "Kontrol edilecek cihaz\u0131 se\u00e7.": "Valitse ohjattava laite.", // EN: Choose the device to control.
    "Sens\u00f6rlerinin \u00f6l\u00e7t\u00fc\u011f\u00fc hava kalitesini, s\u0131cakl\u0131\u011f\u0131 ve nemi g\u00f6r; ar\u0131t\u0131c\u0131n\u0131 y\u00f6net.": "Katso antureidesi mittaama ilman laatu, l\u00e4mp\u00f6tila ja kosteus ja ohjaa puhdistinta.", // EN: See the air quality, temperature and humidity your sensors measure, and control your purifier.
    "I\u015f\u0131klar\u0131, perdeleri ve klimay\u0131 g\u00fcne ba\u015flarken tek dokunu\u015fla haz\u0131rla.": "Valmista valot, verhot ja ilmastointi p\u00e4iv\u00e4\u00e4 varten yhdell\u00e4 napautuksella.", // EN: Get lights, curtains and the AC ready for the day with one tap.
    "Eve girerken \u0131\u015f\u0131klar\u0131, perdeleri ve iklimi birlikte a\u00e7.": "Sytyt\u00e4 valot, verhot ja ilmasto yhdess\u00e4, kun tulet kotiin.", // EN: Turn on lights, curtains and climate together when you get home.
    "Uzun s\u00fcre evde yokken cihazlar\u0131n\u0131 g\u00fcvenli ve tasarruflu konuma al.": "Aseta laitteesi turvalliseen, energiaa s\u00e4\u00e4st\u00e4v\u00e4\u00e4n tilaan, kun olet pitk\u00e4\u00e4n poissa.", // EN: Put your devices into a safe, energy-saving state while you are away for long.
    "I\u015f\u0131klar\u0131 k\u0131s, perdeleri kapat ve TV'yi a\u00e7.": "Himmenn\u00e4 valot, sulje verhot ja k\u00e4ynnist\u00e4 televisio.", // EN: Dim the lights, close the curtains and turn on the TV.
    "Robot s\u00fcp\u00fcrgeni ba\u015flat ya da \u015farj istasyonuna g\u00f6nder.": "K\u00e4ynnist\u00e4 robottiimuri tai l\u00e4het\u00e4 se takaisin telakkaan.", // EN: Start your robot vacuum or send it back to its dock.
    "Kap\u0131y\u0131 kilitle, perdeleri kapat ve evi geceye haz\u0131rla.": "Lukitse ovi, sulje verhot ja laita talo valmiiksi y\u00f6t\u00e4 varten.", // EN: Lock the door, close the curtains and get the house ready for the night.
    "Ekledi\u011fin kameralar\u0131n durumunu ve gizlilik ayar\u0131n\u0131 tek ekranda g\u00f6r.": "N\u00e4et kameroiden tilan ja tietosuoja-asetukset yhdelt\u00e4 n\u00e4yt\u00f6lt\u00e4.", // EN: See the status and privacy setting of your cameras on one screen.
    "Evdeyken kameralar\u0131n i\u00e7in gizlilik modunu tek yerden a\u00e7 ya da kapat.": "Ota kameroiden yksityisyystila k\u00e4ytt\u00f6\u00f6n tai poista se k\u00e4yt\u00f6st\u00e4 yhdest\u00e4 paikasta ollessasi kotona.", // EN: Turn privacy mode for your cameras on or off from one place while you are home.
    "Bug\u00fcn hangi otomasyonun ne zaman \u00e7al\u0131\u015faca\u011f\u0131n\u0131 g\u00f6r.": "Katso, mik\u00e4 automaatio toimii milloin t\u00e4n\u00e4\u00e4n.", // EN: See which automation runs when today.
    "Ev halk\u0131yla notlar\u0131 ve yap\u0131lacaklar\u0131 payla\u015f.": "Jaa muistiinpanot ja teht\u00e4v\u00e4t perheesi kanssa.", // EN: Share notes and to-dos with your household.
    "Sens\u00f6rlerinin \u00f6l\u00e7t\u00fc\u011f\u00fc hava, nem ve s\u0131cakl\u0131ktan evinin sa\u011fl\u0131k \u00f6zetini g\u00f6r.": "Katso kotisi terveysyhteenveto ilmasta, kosteudesta ja l\u00e4mp\u00f6tilasta, jonka anturit mittaavat.", // EN: See your home's health summary from the air, humidity and temperature your sensors measure.
