    "Bu hesap Google ile a\u00e7\u0131ld\u0131, i\u00e7inde hen\u00fcz bir \u015fifre yok. \u0130lk \u015fifreni burada belirleyebilirsin; bundan sonra e-posta ve \u015fifreyle de giri\u015f yapabilirsin.": "T\u00e4m\u00e4 tili avattiin Googlessa, eik\u00e4 sill\u00e4 ole viel\u00e4 salasanaa.Aseta ensimm\u00e4inen salasanasi t\u00e4h\u00e4n;sen j\u00e4lkeen voit my\u00f6s kirjautua sis\u00e4\u00e4n s\u00e4hk\u00f6postilla ja salasanalla.", // EN: This account was opened with Google and has no password yet. Set your first password here; after that you can also sign in with email and password.
    "\u015eifre belirleme ba\u011flant\u0131s\u0131n\u0131 e-postama g\u00f6nder": "L\u00e4het\u00e4 minulle s\u00e4hk\u00f6postilla salasanan asetuslinkki", // EN: Email me a password setup link
    "Bu i\u015flem ek do\u011frulama istiyor. A\u015fa\u011f\u0131dan \u015fifre belirleme ba\u011flant\u0131s\u0131 isteyebilirsin.": "T\u00e4m\u00e4 toiminto vaatii lis\u00e4vahvistuksen.Voit pyyt\u00e4\u00e4 salasanan asetuslinkin alla.", // EN: This action needs extra verification. You can request a password setup link below.
    "\u015eifre belirleme ba\u011flant\u0131s\u0131 e-postana g\u00f6nderildi \u2713": "Salasanan asetuslinkki l\u00e4hetetty postilaatikkoosi \u2713", // EN: Password setup link sent to your inbox ✓
    "\u015eifre ba\u011flant\u0131s\u0131 \u015fu anda g\u00f6nderilemiyor.": "Salasanalinkki\u00e4 ei voi l\u00e4hett\u00e4\u00e4 juuri nyt.", // EN: The password link can't be sent right now.
    "Giri\u015f e-postan bulunamad\u0131; \u00f6nce giri\u015f yap.": "Emme l\u00f6yt\u00e4neet kirjautumiss\u00e4hk\u00f6postiosoitettasi.kirjaudu sis\u00e4\u00e4n ensin.", // EN: We couldn't find your sign-in email; sign in first.
    "Ba\u011flant\u0131 g\u00f6nderilemedi. Birazdan tekrar dene.": "Linkki\u00e4 ei voitu l\u00e4hett\u00e4\u00e4.Yrit\u00e4 hetken kuluttua uudelleen.", // EN: The link couldn't be sent. Try again in a moment.
    "A\u00e7\u0131l\u0131r": "Syttyy", // EN: Turns on
    "Kapan\u0131r": "Sammuu", // EN: Turns off
    "S\u0131cak \u0131\u015f\u0131k": "L\u00e4mmin valo", // EN: Warm light
