    "Bu cihazdaki g\u00fcvenlik/acil olaylar\u0131n ba\u015fl\u0131\u011f\u0131 ve k\u0131sa metni evdeki di\u011fer \u00fcyelerin uygulamas\u0131nda g\u00f6r\u00fcn\u00fcr. Cihaz bilgileri ve anahtarlar payla\u015f\u0131lmaz; her \u00fcye kendi bildirim ayarlar\u0131na tabidir.": "T\u00e4m\u00e4n laitteen turvallisuus-/h\u00e4t\u00e4tapahtumien otsikko ja lyhyt teksti n\u00e4kyv\u00e4t muiden j\u00e4senten sovelluksissa t\u00e4ss\u00e4 kodissa.Laitteen tietoja ja avaimia ei koskaan jaeta;jokainen j\u00e4sen noudattaa omia ilmoitusasetuksiaan.", // EN: The title and short text of security/emergency events on this device appear in other members' apps in this home. Device details and keys are never shared; every member follows their own notification settings.
    "Evden Ayr\u0131l": "Poistu kotoa", // EN: Leave Home
    "Ayr\u0131l": "L\u00e4hde", // EN: Leave
    "Davet e-postas\u0131ndaki kodu gir. Kod tek kullan\u0131ml\u0131kt\u0131r ve yaln\u0131zca davet edilen e-posta adresiyle \u00e7al\u0131\u015f\u0131r.": "Sy\u00f6t\u00e4 kutsus\u00e4hk\u00f6postissa oleva koodi.Koodi on kertak\u00e4ytt\u00f6inen ja toimii vain kutsutun s\u00e4hk\u00f6postiosoitteen kanssa.", // EN: Enter the code from the invitation email. The code is single-use and only works with the invited email address.
    "Oturum gerekli": "Kirjautuminen vaaditaan", // EN: Sign-in required
    "\u00dcye davet etmek i\u00e7in \u00f6nce oturum a\u00e7; evin hesab\u0131na otomatik ba\u011flan\u0131r.": "Kirjaudu ensin sis\u00e4\u00e4n kutsuaksesi j\u00e4seni\u00e4;sinut yhdistet\u00e4\u00e4n kotisi tiliin automaattisesti.", // EN: Sign in first to invite members; you'll be connected to your home's account automatically.
    "E-posta sunucudan g\u00f6nderilemedi": "S\u00e4hk\u00f6postia ei voitu l\u00e4hett\u00e4\u00e4 palvelimelta", // EN: The email couldn't be sent from the server
