    "Cihaza ba\u011flan\u0131lamad\u0131. Ayn\u0131 a\u011fda oldu\u011fundan emin ol.": "Yhteytt\u00e4 laitteeseen ei voitu muodostaa.Varmista, ett\u00e4 se on samassa verkossa.", // EN: Couldn't connect to the device. Make sure it's on the same network.
    "Cihaza ba\u011flan\u0131lamad\u0131. Ayn\u0131 a\u011fda oldu\u011fundan, IP adresinin ve yerel anahtar\u0131n do\u011fru oldu\u011fundan emin ol.": "Yhteytt\u00e4 laitteeseen ei voitu muodostaa.Varmista, ett\u00e4 se on samassa verkossa ja ett\u00e4 IP-osoite ja paikallinen avain ovat oikein.", // EN: Couldn't connect to the device. Make sure it's on the same network and that the IP address and local key are correct.
    "I\u015f\u0131klar\u0131 s\u0131cak tonda a\u00e7ar, perdeleri a\u00e7ar, klimay\u0131 22\u00b0 yapar.": "Sytytt\u00e4\u00e4 valot l\u00e4mpim\u00e4ll\u00e4 s\u00e4vyll\u00e4, avaa verhot ja s\u00e4\u00e4t\u00e4\u00e4 AC:n 22\u00b0:een.", // EN: Turns the lights on in a warm tone, opens the curtains and sets the AC to 22°.
    "I\u015f\u0131klar\u0131 ve perdeleri a\u00e7ar, klimay\u0131 22\u00b0 \u00e7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131r\u0131r, s\u00fcp\u00fcrgeyi \u015farja g\u00f6nderir.": "Sytytt\u00e4\u00e4 valot ja avaa verhot, k\u00e4ytt\u00e4\u00e4 vaihtovirtaa 22\u00b0 kulmassa ja l\u00e4hett\u00e4\u00e4 imurin takaisin latautumaan.", // EN: Turns on the lights and opens the curtains, runs the AC at 22° and sends the vacuum back to charge.
    "I\u015f\u0131k, TV ve klimay\u0131 kapat\u0131r, perdeleri kapat\u0131r, kap\u0131y\u0131 kilitler.": "Sammuttaa valot, television ja AC:n, sulkee verhot ja lukitsee oven.", // EN: Turns off the lights, TV and AC, closes the curtains and locks the door.
    "I\u015f\u0131klar\u0131 ve TV'yi kapat\u0131r, perdeleri kapat\u0131r, kap\u0131y\u0131 kilitler.": "Sammuttaa valot ja television, sulkee verhot ja lukitsee oven.", // EN: Turns off the lights and TV, closes the curtains and locks the door.
    "I\u015f\u0131klar\u0131 %15 s\u0131cak tona getirir, perdeleri kapat\u0131r, TV'yi a\u00e7ar.": "Asettaa valot l\u00e4mpim\u00e4\u00e4n 15 %:iin, sulkee verhot ja k\u00e4ynnist\u00e4\u00e4 television.", // EN: Sets the lights to a warm tone at 15%, closes the curtains and turns on the TV.
